  "author": "Flubsound (Flubes & Claude)",
  "description": "Makes built-in laptop and tablet speakers sound fuller and wider. Bass the drivers cannot reproduce is replaced by psychoacoustic harmonics above a 150 Hz speaker limit (small-speaker mode), which also frees headroom, the image is widened above 300 Hz, the tinny edge is softened and gentle compression adds density.",
